"text":"Multiattack."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The dragon can use its Frightful Presence. It then makes three attacks: one with its bite and two with its claws."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Bite."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Melee Weapon Attack:"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"+14"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"to hit, reach 10 ft., one target."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Hit:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"19"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(2d10 + 8)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"piercing damage plus 7"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(2d6)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"fire damage."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Claw."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Melee Weapon Attack:"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"+14"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"to hit, reach 5 ft., one target."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Hit:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"15"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(2d6 + 8)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"slashing damage."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Tail."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Melee Weapon Attack:"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"+14"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"to hit, reach 15 ft., one target."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Hit:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"17"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(2d8 + 8)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"bludgeoning damage."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Frightful Presence."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"Each creature of the dragon’s choice that is within 120 feet of the dragon and aware of it must succeed on a DC 19 Wisdom saving throw or become"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"frightened"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"for 1 minute. A creature can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. If a creature’s saving throw is successful or the effect ends for it, the creature is immune to the dragon’s Frightful Presence for the next 24 hours."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Fire Breath"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(Recharge 5–6)"},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The dragon exhales fire in a 60-foot cone. Each creature in that area must make a DC 21 Dexterity saving throw, taking 63"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(18d6)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one."},{"element":"div","class":"mon-stat-block__description-block-heading","text":"Legendary Actions"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The dragon can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The dragon regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Detect."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The dragon makes a Wisdom ("},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover skill-tooltip","text":"Perception"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":") check."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Tail Attack."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The dragon makes a tail attack."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Wing Attack (Costs 2 Actions)."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The dragon beats its wings. Each creature within 10 feet of the dragon must succeed on a DC 22 Dexterity saving throw or take 15"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(2d6 + 8)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"bludgeoning damage and be knocked"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"prone"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":". The dragon can then fly up to half its flying speed."}],"tags":142,"max_dom_depth":8}